  recap: "Client trust — clear agreements (dispute prevention), responsible data handling (your security training applied to client data), and honest disclosure (about AI's role, limits, and your verification) — is the professional foundation everything rests on and a competitive advantage in a casual market; your course's verification, security, and honesty training uniquely equips you to be the trustworthy operator clients choose and pay premium for.",
